  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Many are requesting a companion app that isn't VRChat in its entirety but a companion social app that works in tandem, I'd like to request if not a tack on of that, a simple app that is just for using as a basic hand controller to take advantage of the phone's Gyro/accelerometer and onscreen/button controls. \n\nThere are a few 'third party' options out there, none of which are free, and/or none of which i've been able to get working at all - so something that connects directly to VRC's API directly without the need of a secondary app on the target device (PC etc.) would be preferable that just lets you use the phone as a hand controller and nothing more. \n\nWould be useful for people who don't have/can't afford a full set, or are maybe waiting for a replacement in the mail.",
